    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From the creator of Pythagoria &amp; Aurora Nights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a quiz to test your intuition and knowledge - and learn some interesting and specific facts along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: decide whether the statements are true or false. Some of them may seem pretty crazy, but they are true; while other &quot;facts&quot; are actually false. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is there a chocolate-scented flower? You will soon know the answer! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 surprising and entertaining facts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calm and relaxing OST. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRM-free. You can play the game anywhere anytime!</p></li></ul>",
